From c6c01ea61289a436638c643bcf5472cd60c84c26 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: shota <monyuonyu@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 9 Nov 2026 13:46:28 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 423/426] Command line: --check-update and --update <folder>

--check-update asks GitHub for the newest freecad-ja-unified release and
says it beside the one running, with its file for this system, address and
SHA256 (exit code 10 when newer). --update downloads that file into the
folder and checks its SHA256 (a mismatch is removed); the one running is
left as it is. The release running is read from release.txt, which the
release build writes (dev otherwise).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
